    {
      "id": "claim_75c9c98c751a4940862b6f099b0595b1",
      "statement": "Co-owned JSON is withdrawn by subtraction rather than rewriting, and the subtraction patch is rebuilt from the very constants the modules merge, which is what makes the round-trip test a guard against a module starting to merge something removal does not know about.",
